stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROPOSED
  PROPOSED --> SUPPORTED: evidence passes initial check
  PROPOSED --> REJECTED: predicate disproved
  PROPOSED --> INCONCLUSIVE: insufficient evidence
  SUPPORTED --> VERIFIED: mandatory links and replay pass
  SUPPORTED --> REJECTED: valid contradictory evaluation
  SUPPORTED --> INCONCLUSIVE: replay unavailable or invalid
  VERIFIED --> REVOKED: evidence invalidated
  REVOKED --> [*]
